e_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T22:34:01Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T22:34:11Z","body":"I am reading that compatibility is also seeing the issue, meaning there is a general problem with batching, as the `RenderRD` batching implementation was copied from the GLES3 implementation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603313243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603335603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2603335603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2603335603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bK7-z","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T23:01:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T23:14:50Z","body":">Unexpected\n>4.3 stable, Compatibility\n>Current version if I change renderers. What I saw early on and didn't understand if I was just doing something wrong:\n\nCan also be reproduced on MacMini M1. _(`4.3 stable, OpenGL API 4.1 Metal - 89.3 - Compatibility`)_\nI wasn't able to try out previous versions. --> `TileMapLayer` is not found\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75c5aed6-9ba8-4a4e-9476-55551cab1563)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603335603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603469199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2603469199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2603469199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLcmP","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T01:55:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T13:39:38Z","body":"I think I was able to find a workaround for \"Compatibility\".\n@TanyaPegasus Does it also work in your productive project?\n\nThe issue is reproducible from a certain number of objects if they are visible. `$BackBufferCopy.show_behind_parent = true` somehow prevents this. (and `$BackBufferCopy/Add.top_level = true` to see the changes to the layer)\n\n<details><summary>screenshot</summary>\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0b256ed-0de7-45e6-b901-6f1ae75c77cc)\n\n</details>\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t$BackBufferCopy.show_behind_parent = true\n\t$BackBufferCopy/Add.top_level = true\n\tset_biome_tiles()\n\tset_overlay()\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c56c300b-b1ba-45aa-ad21-1812b70fa8ab)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603469199/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603488412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2603488412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2603488412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLhSc","user":{"login":"TanyaPegasus","id":131164516,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FpZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131164516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus","html_url":"https://github.com/TanyaPegasus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T02:16:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T02:16:27Z","body":"Yes, I can confirm that with the Compatibility renderer in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8] that code prevents the rendering issue in my project with significantly more scenes and textures being shown.\nI do have more layers in my main project, and that puts an overlay over layers that aren't supposed to have one. I'm sure knowing something that fixes it helps narrow down the cause though.\n\nI'll check Forward+ on the beta version now.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603488412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603494708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2603494708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2603494708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bLi00","user":{"login":"TanyaPegasus","id":131164516,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FpZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131164516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus","html_url":"https://github.com/TanyaPegasus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TanyaPegasus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T02:24:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-21T02:24:04Z","body":"No rendering issues using forward+ and v4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3] if I add this to my _ready function:\n\n```\n$BackBufferCopy.show_behind_parent = true\n$BackBufferCopy/Add.top_level = true\n```\n\nAs I said, it's also putting the overlay too high in my specific project, but I image that could be more to do with me not understanding how to tweak that to fit better.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603494708/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605626175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2605626175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2605626175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bTrM_","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-21T20:01:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T13:40:27Z","body":"> As I said, it's also putting the overlay too high in my specific project, but I image that could be more to do with me not understanding how to tweak that to fit better.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2812968f-250e-4dc6-b588-0a5690850268)\n\nwith `z_index` you have more control over the order, this workaround also works without `show_behind_parent` and `top_level`\n\n\n```gdscript\n\t$BackBufferCopy.z_index = -1\n\t$BackBufferCopy/Add.z_index = 10\n```\n_Reproducible with 4.4 beta 1 (compatibility and forward+ / Metal on MacOS)_\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2605626175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2609959325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2609959325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2609959325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bkNGd","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T14:30:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T14:30:33Z","body":"I was able to partially understand the C++ sources. Adjusting `show_behind_parent` or `z_index` and \"executing\" `BackBufferCopy` first is not a solution, because this will or can disable the backbuffer.\n\n\nAs soon as I find more time, I will first try to create an MRP with fewer nodes / draw calls.\n\n<details><summary>some details</summary>\n\n----------- \n\nThe issues occur as soon as the `item_buffer_size` limit is reached and `BackBufferCopy` actions have been performed beforehand. In the RenderDoc application it looks like the correct buffers are not being used. _(To render the textures correctly. But I would need to do more testing first to confirm this)_\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b0655dc86f096b3496a9ab5b18965676d4fb35ba/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_canvas_gles3.cpp#L1549\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab4ac68c-c069-4323-840f-8356543ebf3d)\n\nOpenGL ES (Compatibility)\n[rendering/gl_compatibility/item_buffer_size](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-gl-compatibility-item-buffer-size)\n\nmaybe for Vulkan (Forward+ / Mobile)\n[rendering/2d/batching/item_buffer_size](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-rendering-2d-batching-item-buffer-size)\n\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2609959325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611091583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2611091583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2611091583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bohh_","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-23T21:51:46Z","updated_at":"2025-01-23T21:51:57Z","body":"@Alex2782 nice find – that is indeed the issue; when increasing the `rendering/2d/batching/item_buffer_size` to 100000, the issue doesn't show up until zooming completely out. \n\nI will continue to debug the issue tonight to see what is going on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2611091583/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613382288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101686#issuecomment-2613382288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101686","id":2613382288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bxQyQ","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stua